From u5fa2a363d4ddd1d1 at groups.google.com  Fri Feb  7 02:56:37 2020
From: u5fa2a363d4ddd1d1 at groups.google.com (Chris Paciorek)
Date: Fri, 07 Feb 2020 02:56:37 +0000
Subject: Re: out of sample predictions
Message-ID: <0kwzTJQ2Zvc.Iq-icvGKAQAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <0kwzTJQ2Zvc._Gc2rphgAQAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
