Dear all,

I'm a prospective Nimble user, especially attracted by the possibility of using automated-factor slice sampling with it.

A question: is it possible to use arbitrary-precision numerics in defining a nimbleFunction, eg as provided by the Rmpfr package? (Even at the cost of not compiling the function.)

Cheers,
Luca

