Yes, Chris is right all around, I'll just add - on the first run of the MCMC, you should use reset = TRUE.  This will be necessary to initialize all the samplers properly.  Then, on subsequent runs (actually continuations of the same MCMC run) you're fine to use reset = FALSE.

